{
    "title": "Truple - Online Accountability",
    "description": "With Truple you can virtually \"peek\" over your child's shoulder & course-correct as needed. Whether its pornography, sexting, cyber-bullying, violence or excessive screen time, Truple will help you detect it early so you can prevent and fix issues before they turn into life-long problems.\r\n\r\n<b>Reviews from real customers</b>\r\n\u2022 <i>Perfect for our families needs.</i> - Kirsten B\r\n\u2022 <i>This is what I've been looking for as a parent for years. This program is superior to any filter.</i> - B Shaff\r\n\u2022 <i>Easy to setup and use... This concept is superior to all other accountability software.</i> - David G\r\n\r\n<b>Protect from Porn & Online Filth</b>\r\nTruple helps you keep your loved ones safe online by:\r\n1. Reducing temptation by preventing the ability to view porn & other online filth in secret\r\n2. Reporting activity daily or weekly\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features</b>\r\n\u2022 Capture screenshots on a random interval and immediately if a bad app/website opened\r\n\u2022 End-to-end encryption ensures your data is secure\r\n\u2022 Records websites visited & apps used\r\n\u2022 Reports screen & app time\r\n\u2022 Reports are updated in near real time\r\n\u2022 Summary reports emailed daily or weekly\r\n\u2022 Uninstall alerts\r\n\r\n<b>Supported Platforms</b>\r\n\u2022 Truple works on all major platforms. One subscription allows you to monitor all the devices in your home\r\n\r\n<b>Other features</b>\r\n\u2022 We are the only accountability app to offer end-to-end encryption to keep your data private and secure\r\n\u2022 Optional screenshot blurring\r\n\u2022 Optional text redaction (black out words) from screenshots\r\n\u2022 Immediate alerts when bad sites visited\r\n\u2022 Artificial intelligence scans screenshots & websites, flags high risk ones\r\n\u2022 Alerts when incognito/private browsers are used\r\n\u2022 Pause screenshots for specific apps\r\n\u2022 Detects & reports safe mode\r\n\u2022 Web filter support included\r\n\u2022 We make a best attempt at blocking screenshots from banking sites, financial & healthcare apps, and government sites.\r\n\u2022 All accountability data sent over HTTPS and encrypted with AES-256 (plus end-to-end encryption once enabled)\r\n\r\nA subscription is required, and starts at $13.33 / month paid annually.  Please note, <b>uninstalling the Truple app will not automatically cancel your account</b>.\r\n\r\n<i>This app uses Accessibility services.  It uses the BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE permission in order to know which apps are used and which websites are visited.</i>\r\n\r\n<i>This app uses the Device Administrator permission.  The Device Administrator permission is used to send reports about attempts to uninstall Truple.</i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "With Truple you can virtually &quot;peek&quot; over your child&#39;s shoulder &amp; course-correct as needed. Whether its pornography, sexting, cyber-bullying, violence or excessive screen time, Truple will help you detect it early so you can prevent and fix issues before they turn into life-long problems.<br><br><b>Reviews from real customers</b><br>\u2022 <i>Perfect for our families needs.</i> - Kirsten B<br>\u2022 <i>This is what I&#39;ve been looking for as a parent for years. This program is superior to any filter.</i> - B Shaff<br>\u2022 <i>Easy to setup and use... This concept is superior to all other accountability software.</i> - David G<br><br><b>Protect from Porn &amp; Online Filth</b><br>Truple helps you keep your loved ones safe online by:<br>1. Reducing temptation by preventing the ability to view porn &amp; other online filth in secret<br>2. Reporting activity daily or weekly<br><br><b>Key Features</b><br>\u2022 Capture screenshots on a random interval and immediately if a bad app/website opened<br>\u2022 End-to-end encryption ensures your data is secure<br>\u2022 Records websites visited &amp; apps used<br>\u2022 Reports screen &amp; app time<br>\u2022 Reports are updated in near real time<br>\u2022 Summary reports emailed daily or weekly<br>\u2022 Uninstall alerts<br><br><b>Supported Platforms</b><br>\u2022 Truple works on all major platforms. One subscription allows you to monitor all the devices in your home<br><br><b>Other features</b><br>\u2022 We are the only accountability app to offer end-to-end encryption to keep your data private and secure<br>\u2022 Optional screenshot blurring<br>\u2022 Optional text redaction (black out words) from screenshots<br>\u2022 Immediate alerts when bad sites visited<br>\u2022 Artificial intelligence scans screenshots &amp; websites, flags high risk ones<br>\u2022 Alerts when incognito/private browsers are used<br>\u2022 Pause screenshots for specific apps<br>\u2022 Detects &amp; reports safe mode<br>\u2022 Web filter support included<br>\u2022 We make a best attempt at blocking screenshots from banking sites, financial &amp; healthcare apps, and government sites.<br>\u2022 All accountability data sent over HTTPS and encrypted with AES-256 (plus end-to-end encryption once enabled)<br><br>A subscription is required, and starts at $13.33 / month paid annually.  Please note, <b>uninstalling the Truple app will not automatically cancel your account</b>.<br><br><i>This app uses Accessibility services.  It uses the BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE permission in order to know which apps are used and which websites are visited.</i><br><br><i>This app uses the Device Administrator permission.  The Device Administrator permission is used to send reports about attempts to uninstall Truple.</i>",
